    details: "High-tech operation:\n* **Double Conversion:** The incoming alternating current (AC) is continuously converted into direct current (DC) to recharge the batteries, and then reconverted by the inverter into perfectly clean and stabilized alternating current (AC) to power the devices.\n* **Zero switching time (0 ms):** Because the inverter is already active in line and constantly powers the load, in case of a total blackout the transition occurs without any interruption or micro-delay.\n* It offers the highest level of electrical isolation from disturbances, surges, harmonic distortions and lightning, at the cost of higher costs and more heat generated.",
