    scenario: "A financial-services SaaS provider wants to host its new platform on infrastructure where the physical hardware is entirely dedicated to the organization to satisfy strict banking compliance requirements (PCI-DSS), while still benefiting from the elasticity, self-service and automation typical of the public cloud.",
    question: "Which cloud deployment model best meets this specific need?",
